{'symbol': 'MO', 'date': '2022-06-01 07:00:00', 'title': 'PODA ANNOUNCES FILING OF INFORMATION CIRCULAR FOR SPECIAL MEETING', 'text': '\u200eVANCOUVER, BC, JUNE 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ - PODA HOLDINGS, INC. ("PODA" OR THE "COMPANY") (CSE: PODA) \u200e(FSE: 99L) (OTC: PODAF)\xa0IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT, FURTHER TO ITS NEWS RELEASE DATED MAY 13, 2022 IN RESPECT OF THE PROPOSED SALE OF ALL OR SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE COMPANY\'S ASSETS TO ALTRIA CLIENT SERVICES LLC ("ALCS"), A SUBSIDIARY OF ALTRIA GROUP, INC. (NYSE: MO), IT HAS FILED A MANAGEMENT INFORMATION \u200eCIRCULAR (THE "CIRCULAR") IN CONNECTION WITH \u200eTHE UPCOMING\xa0MEETING OF THE HOLDERS OF THE COMPANY\'S SHARES (THE "SHAREHOLDERS") CALLED FOR JUNE 22, 2022 \u200e\u200e(THE\xa0"MEETING").'}